If you have the good sense to stay away from altar saccing, you're very
unlikely to have any artifacts by the time you hit the Castle; if you're
Lawful, you are likely to have only Excalibur.

Dunno about you, but I usually do the Quest after the Castle for exactly
this reason; get your artifacts from the castle before the QA is
generated, and then mop the floor with the dungeon and go ascend.

> For a cockatrice corpse, if you get into a tight corner.  It's
> always nice to have some in reserve.  Not as nice as having some
> more or less essential equipment, of course, but once you've
