Inexperienced players should burn the wand down to 1:1 or 1:0; saved
wishes are less useful to them because they aren't able to recognize
when they need to burn one and when they don't.  Equipment in hand will
help keep them alive longer.

Experienced players can do whatever they want because they'll know how
to wish themselves out of trouble; that said, saving more than a single
wish is still not as good as getting a bunch of helpful EQ in their
fists.

